\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/30-50.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ar-Room 30:50 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Maka perhatikanlah bekas-bekas rahmat Allah, bagaimana Allah menghidupkan bumi setelah mati (kering). Sungguh, itu berarti Dia pasti (berkuasa) menghidupka\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Ar-Room\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/30.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 50\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/30-50.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/30.html\">Surah Ar-Room</a> › Ayat 50</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ar-Room 30:50</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَانظُرْ إِلَىٰ آثَارِ رَحْمَتِ اللَّهِ كَيْفَ يُحْيِي الْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ مَوْتِهَا إِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ لَمُحْيِي الْمَوْتَىٰ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Maka perhatikanlah bekas-bekas rahmat Allah, bagaimana Allah menghidupkan bumi setelah mati (kering). Sungguh, itu berarti Dia pasti (berkuasa) menghidupkan yang telah mati. Dan Dia Mahakuasa atas segala sesuatu.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولم يقل الله فانظر إلى آثار خطى الله وإنما قال: آثار رحمة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 3/386</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ورحمته هنا النبات.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 3/386</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s30a50\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/30-48.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (30:48)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/30-57.html\">Ayat berikutnya (30:57)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/30-57.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Ar-Room 30:57 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Maka pada hari itu tidak bermanfaat (lagi) permintaan maaf orang-orang yang zalim, dan mereka tidak pula diberi kesempatan bertobat lagi.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/30-57.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Ar-Room 30:57 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Maka pada hari itu tidak bermanfaat (lagi) permintaan maaf orang-orang yang zalim, dan mereka tidak pula diberi kesempatan bertobat lagi.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Beranda\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Ar-Room\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/30.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 57\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/30-57.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/30.html\">Surah Ar-Room</a> › Ayat 57</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Ar-Room 30:57</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَيَوْمَئِذٍ لَّا يَنفَعُ الَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا مَعْذِرَتُهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُسْتَعْتَبُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Maka pada hari itu tidak bermanfaat (lagi) permintaan maaf orang-orang yang zalim, dan mereka tidak pula diberi kesempatan bertobat lagi.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلا يطلب منهم يوم القيامة أن يعتبوا ربهم فيزيلوا عتبه بطاعته واتباع رسله وكذلك قوله: {فيومئذ لا ينفع الذين ظلموا معذرتهم ولا هم يستعتبون}<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 4/181</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s30a57\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/30-50.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (30:50)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}